  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - West Africa Power Pool 225kV Cte dIvoire-Liberia Transmission Interconnection, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for the West Africa Power Pool to provide the technical, economic, and environmental for a 225 kV transmission line and related substation and distribution equipment from Cte dIvoire to Liberia (Project). The Project is anticipated to provide energy access to communities along the Project, as well as create greater resiliency and enable to greater deployment of renewable energy generation for the West Africa Power Pool.</narrative>
  </description>
